<title>UK: Millennium buys hotel for 81 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Millennium buys hotel for 81 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millennium &amp; Copthorne Hotels Plc said on Tuesday that it is buying the Britannia Hotel from Inter-Continental Hotels and Resorts for 81 million stg.</p>
<p>Millennium said it is buying the whole of the share capital of London Britannia Hotel Ltd, whose sole trading asset is the Britannia Hotel.</p>
<p>The Britannia Hotel is a four-star hotel with 318 rooms in the centre of London's exclusive Mayfair district.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
